  "fidelVowelExplainerTitle": "Every sign is a syllable",
  "fidelVowelExplainerIntro": "ለ is not \"l\", it's \"le\" - every Fidel sign stands for a whole syllable sound, not just a consonant.",
  "fidelVowelExplainerRow1Title": "Look at the ሀ (h) row",
  "fidelVowelExplainerRow1Body": "Seven forms, seven vowels - the base shape stays, only the vowel part (colored) changes.",
